      "created_at": "2012-09-20T13:17:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can Unity use a golem to take damage that is directed at Unity? If \"yes\", then if an environment card does 1 damage to each non-environment target can a golem take both the 1-damage directed at it and the damage directed at Unity?</p>",
