      "created_at": "2012-09-22T16:44:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can Unity play Golems when it isn't her play phase? I'm assuming that's the intent behind Scrap Metal's start of turn trugger, but I was wondering if that also applied to, say, the perform ability on Argent Adept's Alacritous Subdominant or similar powers? I'm going with yes unless told otherwise, but just wanted to check.</p>",
